{"suttaId":"tha-ap274","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8569,8584],"vripara":"5"},"segments":{"tha-ap274:0.3":"Tilamuṭṭhidāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap274:1.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya, satthā lokagganāyako;","tha-ap274:1.3":"Manomayena kāyena, iddhiyā upasaṅkami.","tha-ap274:2.1":"“Satthāraṃ upasaṅkantaṃ, vanditvā purisuttamaṃ;","tha-ap274:2.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, tilamuṭṭhimadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap274:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ dānamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap274:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, tilamuṭṭhiyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap274:4.1":"“Ito soḷasakappamhi, tantiso [khantiyo (syā.)] nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap274:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap274:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap274:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tilamuṭṭhidāyako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap274:7.1":"Tilamuṭṭhidāyakattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3232,"to":3232,"paras":[{"para":3232,"vripara":"5","refs":["tha-ap274:1"],"words":["manomayena kāyenā"],"lines":["Dutiyāpadāne <b>manomayena kāyenā</b>ti yathā cittavasena pavattakāyenāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap274:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
